<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - US Home said raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - US Home said raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- U.S. Home Corp shares were raised by Smith Barney to a buy from their prior rating of outperform on Friday, according to source.</p>
<p>-- U.S. Home shares closed at 21-1/2 on Thursday.</p>
</text>
